<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian security forces are expanding anti-ISIS raids and targeting former regime loyalists while private security firms support a new Syrian security mogul, and they are disrupting drug-smuggling attempts on the Iraq and Jordan borders. Israeli drones struck a Syrian operative planning attacks for Iran near the Lebanon border, prompting a UN Security Council call for respect of the 1974 Disengagement Agreement. The Syrian army began destroying chemical weapons stockpiles and the UK allocated $90 million to support Syria's economic recovery. Jordan and Syria’s foreign ministers discussed bilateral ties and regional developments. 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNT291Y1V5blpNRHJ4WGpHOG14M21WUnIxcWhzM1BJZGlSYUFaUUpqMFJucU5PM0lrcTRiRHhGcDBxSU82U2M0N2JVdTdBbEt6a0Jzam9CX0hsUThLZWJxXzFhXzVhTkVtalAtWEtxOU4xUml6WWd1ZTBGQ3JxenJkVzREUkdZM2ZWWlJmSUlRUUJkcTQydm1IbHhUUjZDYk90Q056MWtxblJjLS1vczBRbE9CN250dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;OCHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOVnFXaFdDWkhTUmJ4R2RYQ3F2VVZsVmtCTTV6SnRrUW0zQWZPQ2FkN1hRVkV6aEp3aTBFb3VaU0ZuUnN2ZGhIU21GLWd1RUpqTFNBRFdTTHpRbFpMSlgtOXJoUE80SnhsUjZMelFfYXNBYXJzSzlIeFI0VUlJWlNFWGFPaWI1cjVzN1JBU2ZFVGVOM2RvdkRCQ20zZ2JaZlNYenk5WkJHSnBlcDg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Global Arab Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxNcFIwMEROUU9jcktoVUZ6dEFhajM0RVl2MHdqTVZldmR3Y3NuVVJVeXl2bTJwUm83X05Sb0JSTWJ0aGpXZ0JrQlNwRmQtWkNLeWxNam5GbV9BSXNLcGdDZ0VKaFZfQTU2SlhybHVVd1BBVmJUTDhHaXhOM0pwcWhUOXU0MGt5dldBNHA3X3VEVHhJeHBTNlhKXzB6bkl6RXR3cTlNXzB6cjZNdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a